# 🎯 Cursor Rules & Interaction Design

## Quick Reference
- **Core Loop:** Plant seeds → grow plants → harvest → spend fruit to expand soil.  
  Harvesting is always available; Planting and Building run in exclusive modes.
- **Primary Modes:** `Build`, `Plant`, `Water`. Hotkeys `B`, seed hotkeys (`1`, etc.), and `W`.
- **Universal Priorities:** Harvest > Build (valid) > Build (invalid) > Plant (valid) > Plant (invalid) > Water (valid) > Water (invalid).
- **Single Click:** All main interactions fire on a single left click. Right-click or `Esc` exits the active mode.
- **Feedback:** Every action must surface immediate visual and audio feedback; disabled states explain why an action cannot occur.

